    "外部暂时无法主动连入时，仍可尝试连接其他来源，但能找到的来源可能较少，速度也可能较慢。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部暂时无法主动连入时，仍可尝试连接其他来源，但能找到的来源可能较少，速度也可能较慢。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can still connect to other sources when incoming connections are unavailable, but there may be fewer sources and slower speeds."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
